  "description": "Avalonia controls and helpers that ship as types only, with no styling of their own: CalendarView (a single-control calendar with month, year and decade views, range selection, event markers and a picker mode), gallery helpers (LightDarkPreview, Icons, ColorSample), behaviours for stock controls (LabelPairing, ScrollReveal, PickerPopupAlignment, WheelSnap) and converters (FlyoutPlacementTargetWidth, GroupBoxNotchMask, PipsPagerStripExtent, ValidationErrorMessage). Their look comes from whichever AngelSix.ThemeEngine theme the app uses, exactly like a stock Avalonia control.",
